keyword:
	keyword: Gear token
	match: Gear toke<atom-param>*s</atom-param>
	reminder: {if param1.value == "ns" then "They’re artifacts" else "It’s an artifact"} with "T, Sacrifice this token: Untap target nonland permanent. Activate only as a sorcery."
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Flux
	match: Flux <atom-param>number</atom-param> — <atom-param>one_word</atom-param>
	reminder: On your upkeep, put a time counter on this. Whenever there are {english_number_a(param1)} or more, remove {english_number_a(param1)} and trigger the flux ability.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Chrono counters
	match: you get
	reminder: Once each turn as a sorcery, you can spend chrono counters to take an extra step or phase this turn.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Trace
	match: create a trace
	reminder: Traces are cards that become copies when they enter public zones.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Trace
	match: trace<atom-param>*s</atom-param> <atom-param>name</atom-param>
	reminder: Traces can’t exist in graveyards or exile and are tokens while on the battlefield.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
